en":[]},{"t0":26.17,"dur":13.0,"zh":["右側山腳下是鯉魚潭，花蓮縣最大的內陸湖。","湖長約 1.6 公里、寬約 930 公尺。"],"en":["Under the hills on the right: Liyu Lake, Hualien County's largest inland lake.","It is about 1.6 km long and 930 m wide."],"poi":"liyu"},{"t0":39.17,"dur":35.46,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":74.63,"dur":13.0,"zh":["花東縱谷從花蓮市延伸到台東市，長約 180 公里。","右邊是中央山脈，左邊是海岸山脈。"],"en":["The line runs down the Huadong Valley, about 180 km from Hualien City to Taitung City.","The Central Range rises on the right, the Coastal Range on the left."],"poi":"valley"},{"t0":87.63,"dur":39.63,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":127.26,"dur":13.0,"zh":["瑞穗站南邊，列車越過北回歸線。","這裡的北回歸線標誌，最早在 1933 年建於瑞穗車站西側。"],"en":["South of Ruisui station, the train crosses the Tropic of Cancer.","The marker here was first built in 1933, west of Ruisui station."],"poi":"tropic"},{"t0":140.26,"dur":59.55,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":199.81,"dur":19.5,"zh":["左側稻田間是池上的伯朗大道。","筆直的道路兩旁沒有電線桿，只有稻田與遠山。","秋收時節的金黃稻浪，因咖啡廣告而聲名大噪。"],"en":["Among the paddies on the left: Chishang's Mr. Brown Avenue.","The straight road has no utility poles, only rice fields and far mountains.","Its golden autumn harvest became famous through a coffee advertisement."],"poi":"brown"},{"t0":219.31,"dur":35.33,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":254.64,"dur":13.0,"zh":["右側是鹿野高台，平均海拔約 350 公尺。","2011 年起，每年在這裡舉辦臺灣國際熱氣球嘉年華。"],"en":["On the right: the Luye Highlands, about 350 m above the sea.","The Taiwan International Balloon Fiesta has been held here every year since 2011."],"poi":"luye"},{"t0":267.64,"dur":16.36,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":284.0,"dur":6.5,"zh":["抵達台東車站，這段鐵路約 150 公里。"],"en":["Arriving at Taitung station after about 150 km of railway."]},{"t0":290.5,"dur":9.5,"zh":[],"en":[]}],"log":[{"t":0.0,"tt":0,"kind":"dep","zh":"發車：花蓮車站","en":"Departure: Hualien Station"},{"t":32.02,"tt":703,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 3 公里：鯉魚潭","en":"Liyu Lake, 3 km right","k":"liyu"},{"t":80.48,"tt":2283,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 2 公里：花東縱谷","en":"Huadong Valley, 2 km left","k":"valley"},{"t":133.11,"tt":4024,"kind":"poi","zh":